  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PNG Strategic Engagement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding under this initiative supports the delivery of Australia&#x2019;s aid program in Papua New Guinea by providing funds for outreach and communications which will underpin efforts to ensure PNG Government interlocutors are informed of Australia&#x2019;s development programs and objectives. This would include regular outreach sessions, ad-hoc training, briefings, short courses, and strategic communications. Activities respond to the Post Business Plan&#x2019;s performance measure of &#x2018;positive perceptions of Australia&#x2019;s development program&#x2019;, and DPP objectives 2.1 (peace and stability), 2.3 (institutional effectiveness), and 4.2 (institutional linkages).</narrative>
  </description>
